    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403110/extras/cd13b3795e4bca172ac454112c000361.avif?t=1754412990\" /></div>Experience the life of and play 60+ different prehistoric creatures from various parts of the ecosystem.\u00a0 Play as the plant eating herbivores, the meat-eating carnivores, and the fish-eating piscivores. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roam the land, seas, and skies.\u00a0 \u00a0Eat, grow, and survive in an unforgiving world filled with many creatures that can be hunted or hunt you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403110/extras/17d04c6b2dec2ed66aeb65eecd6c56d3.avif?t=1754412990\" /></div>Earn evolution points as you play by eating, killing, and completing tasks.\u00a0 \u00a0Use those points to customize your creature's talents, traits, and attributes and adapt to your surroundings and challenges.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect a hoard of items that can be used to strengthen your creatures, nests, and eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Once mature, creatures can build a nest and spawn eggs that can hatch into their very own brood.\u00a0 You can also empower the eggs you'll spawn with items that you store in your nest inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403110/extras/2d0ba079914aaeb77e3fd83529f70580.avif?t=1754412990\" /></div>\ud83d\udd39<strong>62 playable species include:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ankylosaurus, Archelon, Brachiosaurus, Compsognathus, Dilophosaurus, Dimetrodon, Oviraptor, Parasaurolophus, Pteranodon, Sarcosuchus, Spinosaurus, Stegosaurus, Triceratops, Tryannosaurus, Velociraptor, Argentinosaurus, Baryonyx, Carnotaurus, Gallimimus, Iguanodon, Kentrosaurus, Ouranosaurus, Pachycephalosaurus, Protoceratops, Styracosaurus, Troodon, Dimorphodon, Quetzalcoatlus, Ammonite, Anomalocaris, Cameroceras, Dunkleosteus, Elasmosaurus, Helicoprion, Ophthalmosaurus, Leedsichthys, Megalodon, Tylosaurus, Onchopristis, Xenacanthus, Meganeura, Titanoboa, Trilobite, Skorpiovenator, Suchomimus, Diplocaulus, Edmontosaurus, Padillasaurus, Kryptops, Giganotosaurus, Daspletosaurus, Ceratosaurus, Allosaurus, Inostrancevia, Gorgosaurus, Albertosaurus, Thalassodromeus, Dryosaurus, Acrocanthosaurus, and Therizinosaurus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Just like the creatures you play, this game is ever-growing and improving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Created by a single indie developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39<strong>Demo features full gameplay but game progress is not saved.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Multiplayer with PVP and AI is planned for a future update.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403110/extras/cd13b3795e4bca172ac454112c000361.avif?t=1754412990\" /></div>Experience the life of and play 60+ different prehistoric creatures from various parts of the ecosystem.\u00a0 Play as the plant eating herbivores, the meat-eating carnivores, and the fish-eating piscivores. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roam the land, seas, and skies.\u00a0 \u00a0Eat, grow, and survive in an unforgiving world filled with many creatures that can be hunted or hunt you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403110/extras/17d04c6b2dec2ed66aeb65eecd6c56d3.avif?t=1754412990\" /></div>Earn evolution points as you play by eating, killing, and completing tasks.\u00a0 \u00a0Use those points to customize your creature's talents, traits, and attributes and adapt to your surroundings and challenges.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect a hoard of items that can be used to strengthen your creatures, nests, and eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Once mature, creatures can build a nest and spawn eggs that can hatch into their very own brood.\u00a0 You can also empower the eggs you'll spawn with items that you store in your nest inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403110/extras/2d0ba079914aaeb77e3fd83529f70580.avif?t=1754412990\" /></div>\ud83d\udd39<strong>62 playable species include:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ankylosaurus, Archelon, Brachiosaurus, Compsognathus, Dilophosaurus, Dimetrodon, Oviraptor, Parasaurolophus, Pteranodon, Sarcosuchus, Spinosaurus, Stegosaurus, Triceratops, Tryannosaurus, Velociraptor, Argentinosaurus, Baryonyx, Carnotaurus, Gallimimus, Iguanodon, Kentrosaurus, Ouranosaurus, Pachycephalosaurus, Protoceratops, Styracosaurus, Troodon, Dimorphodon, Quetzalcoatlus, Ammonite, Anomalocaris, Cameroceras, Dunkleosteus, Elasmosaurus, Helicoprion, Ophthalmosaurus, Leedsichthys, Megalodon, Tylosaurus, Onchopristis, Xenacanthus, Meganeura, Titanoboa, Trilobite, Skorpiovenator, Suchomimus, Diplocaulus, Edmontosaurus, Padillasaurus, Kryptops, Giganotosaurus, Daspletosaurus, Ceratosaurus, Allosaurus, Inostrancevia, Gorgosaurus, Albertosaurus, Thalassodromeus, Dryosaurus, Acrocanthosaurus, and Therizinosaurus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Just like the creatures you play, this game is ever-growing and improving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Created by a single indie developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39<strong>Demo features full gameplay but game progress is not saved.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39Multiplayer with PVP and AI is planned for a future update.</p>",
    "short_description": "Can you survive an unforgiving prehistoric world? Enter the world as a hatchling, survive and grow to reach adulthood. Experience the life of and play 60+ different prehistoric species. Gain talents, traits, and a hoard of items to customize your creatures and nests.",
